  <!-- 2026-09-07: the FC-FAIR iframe was removed.
       ============================================
       This block embedded https://fc-fair.dill-picl.org directly in a MaizeGDB
       page. That host is now NXDOMAIN, and dill-picl.org itself is no longer
       the Dill-Picl lab's: it was re-registered on 2025-06-21 through
       Gname.com and serves an Indonesian gambling site. An iframe is worse
       than a link -- whatever the current owner points that subdomain at would
       render inside MaizeGDB's own chrome, under MaizeGDB's name -- so the
       embed is gone rather than merely broken.

       Nothing reaches this template today: /fcfair answers 301 to
       /FAIRpractices, retired 2026-09-04, and /tools/fcfair answers 404. This
       edit is so that restoring either route cannot restore the embed.
       Removed with it: the loading corn-cob gif, which existed only to be
       hidden by the iframe's onload handler.

       The gblade window-name note below the fold does not apply to this page;
       it was copied from the genome browser embed.
   -->
  <p>
    The FC-FAIR tool was hosted by the Dill-Picl lab and is no longer available.
    MaizeGDB's guidance on FAIR data and AI-readiness is at
    <a href="/FAIRpractices">FAIR practices</a>.
  </p>

 
